                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "MAGA Republicans want to stand in between you & your doctor. With their Project 2025, they want to ban abortion, birth control, & IVF, making it impossible for patients to get the reproductive health care they need.\n\nThe @ProChoiceCaucus & I will not let them get away with this.",
