                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Dobbs created an environment in which medical students & patients are suffering because of an extreme agenda that puts politicians into doctor offices & medical schools. Trump & his extreme SCOTUS are to blame for this. We can't allow them to continue to strip away our freedoms.",
