                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This is a dangerous step backward for women in Louisiana. These drugs aren't just used for abortion \u2014 they can induce labor, prevent ulcers, and treat postpartum hemorrhages.\n\nThis is the reality of MAGA's attack on reproductive freedom, delaying life-saving care for patients.",
