                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Once again, we're seeing the devastating impact of Trump's abortion bans. Nevaeh's death isn't an isolated case; it\u2019s part of a growing crisis fueled by the fall of Roe.\n\nHer passing is a heartbreaking reminder of what happens when we deny or delay life-saving care to patients.",
